## geography

The United States is the third or fourth largest country by total area,[^7][^8] with figures ranging between 3,717,813 and 3,809,525 square miles (9,629,091 and 9,866,624 km2).[^7][^9] ([Geography](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States#Geography))

